  "text": "The CAT-DDO 4 was disbursed after Typhoon Rai in December 2021, providing immediate liquidity. Previous CAT-DDOs were successfully drawn for Tropical Storm Washi (2011), Typhoon Mangkhut (2018), and the COVID-19 pandemic. A formal Implementation Completion and Results Report was finalized in April 2025.",
